  note 36 25 1 v 92
  note 48 26 1 v 102
  note 36 27 1 v 94
  note 43 28 1 v 112
  note 43 29 1 v 94
  note 55 30 1 v 104
  note 50 31 1 v 100
  # S3 — driving eighths
  note 45 32 0.5 v 118
  note 45 32.5 0.5 v 94
  note 57 33 0.5 v 110
