  note 45 64 2 v 104
  note 57 66 2 v 92
  note 41 68 2 v 102
  note 53 70 2 v 90
  note 43 72 2 v 102
  note 55 74 2 v 92
  note 45 76 4 v 100

track Pad id pad gen gameBoyDmg layer 0 * 20
  gen type pulse duty 50 env_mode constant vol 5
  gen vib_rate 3 vib_amt 7
  note 64 0 4 v 66
  note 65 4 4 v 64
  note 64 8 4 v 68
  note 62 12 4 v 66
  note 64 16 4 v 74
  note 65 20 4 v 72
  note 67 24 4 v 76
